<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <template id="report_rma_collection_template">
        <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="doc">
                <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                    <div class="page">
                        <div class="oe_structure"/>
                        
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <h2>Comprovante de Coleta (RMA)</h2>
                            <h3 t-field="doc.name"/>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mt32 mb32">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <strong>Cliente:</strong>
                                <p t-field="doc.partner_id"/>
                                <strong>Pedido Original:</strong>
                                <p t-field="doc.sale_order_id"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6 text-right">
                                <strong>Data da Coleta:</strong>
                                <p t-field="doc.date_collected"/>
                                <strong>Marketplace:</strong>
                                <p t-field="doc.marketplace_type"/>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <table class="table table-sm o_main_table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Referência de Rastreio</th>
                                    <th class="text-right">Peso Declarado</th>
                                    <th class="text-right">Tipo de Coleta</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><span t-field="doc.carrier_tracking_ref"/></td>
                                    <td class="text-right"><span t-field="doc.weight_declared"/> kg</td>
                                    <td class="text-right"><span t-field="doc.collection_type"/></td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>

                        <div class="row mt64">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <p><strong>Motorista / Coletor:</strong></p>
                                <p t-field="doc.collector_id"/>
                                <div style="border-top: 1px solid black; width: 80%; margin-top: 20px;">
                                    Assinatura do Motorista
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <p><strong>Assinatura do Cliente:</strong></p>
                                <div t-if="doc.collection_signature">
                                    <img t-att-src="image_data_uri(doc.collection_signature)" style="max-height: 2cm; max-width: 5cm;"/>
                                </div>
                                <div style="border-top: 1px solid black; width: 80%; margin-top: 20px;">
                                    Assinatura do Cliente
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt32">
                            <p>Este documento serve como comprovante legal de que os itens descritos foram coletados para processamento de logística reversa.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="oe_structure"/>
                    </div>
                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>
